    ValueError: If `transpose_a` and `adjoint_a`, or `transpose_b` and
      `adjoint_b` are both set to `True`.
    TypeError: If output_type is specified but the types of `a`, `b` and
      `output_type` is not (u)int8, (u)int8 and int32.

